{%- comment -%}
  AstroFlav product page — one reusable section for every product.

  Everything on this page is driven by Shopify product data (title, images,
  variants, price, description) plus optional metafields, so the same file
  renders every product. Nothing here changes the cart, checkout, apps, or
  any other template.

  Install:
    1. Upload assets/astroflav-product.css, assets/astroflav-product.js and the
       image assets listed in shopify-export/README.md to Assets.
    2. Copy this file to sections/astroflav-product.liquid
    3. Copy templates/product.astroflav.json to templates/
    4. Assign the "astroflav" product template to your products.

  Optional metafields (all have fallbacks):
    custom.card_detail   single line text   — subtitle under the title
    custom.benefits      multi-line text    — one benefit per line, "Label :: detail"
    custom.ingredients   multi-line text    — one per line, "Name :: detail"
    custom.how_to_use    multi-line text    — directions
    custom.supplement_facts  multi-line text (or rich text)
    custom.faq           multi-line text    — one per line, "Question :: answer"
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'astroflav-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

